class HamzahEndometrialBiophysicalRealTimeEngine:
    """
    HamzahXcell: Medical & Biophysical In Vivo/In Vitro Real-Time Simulation Engine (Omega 1155D Grade - Endometrial Focus)
    Implements Hamzah's 4-fold Equivalence Principle, Caputo Fractional Derivatives, and 1155D Lagrangian Mechanics
